  "final_text": "I fixed the bug in `activity/timeparse.py`, and the full test suite now passes (7 tests).\n\n**The bug:** `parse_12h` turned PM hours into 24-hour time but never handled 12 AM. So \"12:10 AM\" was read as 12:10 midday instead of 00:10. That put the after-midnight events in the middle of the day, which split one session into two.\n\n**The fix:** in `parse_12h`, 12 AM now becomes hour 0. The night events are now one 40-minute session (11:40 PM to 12:20 AM), which is what the test expects."
